#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:5 c7b9c2497ba841f6959f07eb0afb4e82
msgid "RC Input Channel Mapping (RCMAP)"
msgstr "RC 输入通道映射（RCMAP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:7 0a7fb529450443a1b12d0293e3ef0b7f
msgid ""
"This article shows how to set up a non-standard RC input channel mapping "
"using the RCMAP feature."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 RCMAP 功能设置非标准 RC 输入通道映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:11 d341c5f685c84bbfb976035b9a7dd22a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:13 718e848f044c4a9e95a32ea406813c2c
msgid "By default the RC input channels are:"
msgstr "默认情况下，RC 输入通道为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:16 f76e89e5bd1e4b90a3f29b8655728480
msgid "Channel 1: Roll input"
msgstr "通道1：横滚输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:17 6158733363cc4a79ba238bb1212e9ed1
msgid "Channel 2: Pitch input"
msgstr "通道2：俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:18 2edbf49b2f9f48529ee29a9420b76bc6
msgid "Channel 3: Throttle input"
msgstr "通道3：油门输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:19 88d61a585c7f4d1d8b5ab592cdd9615b
msgid "Channel 4: Yaw input"
msgstr "通道4：偏航输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:22 150913ed6ccb4b42a89683bb8c6fe96e
msgid ""
"These can be changed by setting the  :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`RCMAP_PITCH <RCMAP_PITCH>`, :ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` and"
" :ref:`RCMAP_YAW <RCMAP_YAW>` parameters using the *Mission Planner*'s "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree** (or Full Parameter List) as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"可通过使用 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree**（或 Full "
"Parameter List）设置 :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`、:ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` 参数来更改这些映射，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:27 3f4c247a66504e9c84ae42745ef2ac98
msgid ""
"After changing any of these parameters the autopilot should be rebooted."
msgstr "修改上述任何参数后，应重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:32 bc79c4c39c6c4b4f9a6c2c5fc0cceefb
msgid ""
"Additional information about the ``RCMAP`` parameters can be found in the "
":ref:`Parameters <plane:RCMAP_ROLL>` reference."
msgstr "关于 ``RCMAP`` 参数的更多信息请参见 :ref:`参数 <plane:RCMAP_ROLL>` 章节。"

